    "mode": "prod, debug disabled; PHP rendering and minification; existing compression settings unchanged"
  },
  "method": [
    "Independent private copies of the installed Altimood and Pied Vert sites, with SQLite backups, null mail transport and private caches/media. Only this change is backported onto their installed dependencies; site code/content remains fixed.",
    "Every measured build starts with a reflink copy of the same previous complete export. Seeding is outside the timed interval. Both control and candidate execute full builds without --incremental and still render every eligible page.",
    "Control autoloads the saved original StaticAppGenerator, StaticWorkerCommand and PageGenerator; candidate passes the previous output directory to sequential generators and workers. Compressor settings and binaries are identical.",
    "Two measurements per backend/site, using control/candidate/candidate/control order. Each uses fresh temporary output and an atomic swap; outputs are retained outside the serving path after completion.",
    "Counters inserted only into the private benchmark Compressor count each copied compressed file and each compress invocation. They do not appear in the committed implementation.",
    "Every regular exported file is hashed and every symlink target compared; no content normalization is needed because the private static path used during generation is constant across modes.",
    "All gzip, Brotli and Zstandard files from the second optimized export are decompressed and individually compared against their corresponding uncompressed files. Zstandard is decoded in ordered batches and split at measured original-file lengths.",
    "Full rebuilds require an existing export for reuse. Cold builds, changed rendered bytes, and missing/empty compressed files use the existing compressors. Incremental rendering policy is unchanged.",
    "This is not a whole-page render cache: Twig, links, dates, publication rules and content dependencies still execute before comparing output bytes.",
    "Shared workstation with background activity and no frequency or thermal isolation. These are local full-rebuild observations, not visitor latency measurements."
  ],
